OL,3,GNEWSATour of Britain in Lincolnshire is
OL,4,A'really cool'
OL,5,
OL,6,FProfessional cyclists and enthusiasts
OL,7,Fhave shared their excitement ahead of
OL,8,Fthe start of the Tour of Britain.
OL,10,FThe 565 miles (910km) cycling race will
OL,11,Fofficially start later with the first
OL,12,Fstage being held in Lincoln. The second
OL,13,Fstage of the race will also be held in
OL,14,FLincolnshire with competitors cycling
OL,15,Ffrom from Boston to Skegness on
OL,16,FThursday.
OL,18,FSian Botteley, from Bourne, will be
OL,19,Fcheering on her husband who is a
OL,20,Fprofessional cyclist and said "it's
OL,21,Freally cool" that the race was being
OL,22,Fheld in the county.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
